    to `batch_dims`.  Defaults to the first non-batch dimension. Supports
    negative indexes.
  batch_dims: An `integer`.  The number of batch dimensions.  Must be less
    than or equal to `rank(indices)`.
  name: A name for the operation (optional).

Returns:
